      "content": "hey i been using this high-end audio analyzer i got lately and im seeing some really weird readings coming from the direction of city hall. there are these constant sub-audible pulses, like way below 20hz, but the amplitude is actually pretty high for that range. it doesnt look like normal building vibration or traffic. the patterns are too rhythmic. can u help me look into what kind of intent someone would have using specific decibel levels in that low frequency range? it feels intentional.",
